{"id":"vod_bf_6520","vodId":"6520","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"刀语","name_cn":"刀语","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-7/e93fb6dcc7b4430e378b6d59005e282c.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在中世纪的日本，鑢七花（细谷佳正 配音）是一个外表强壮头脑简单的男子，生于武术世家的他背负着传承“虚刀流”的重任。从小到大，鑢七花便被当做一把刀来培养，这种变态的教育方式使得他最终走上了弑亲的悲剧道路。在奇策士咎儿（田村由加利 配音）的鼓动和怂恿下，鑢七花踏上了漫漫的修炼之路，他要找到锻制师四季崎记纪（森功至 配音）所锻造的12把名刀，来增强自己的实力。　　一路上，鑢七花遇上了各式各样的敌人，别无选择的他只得一一将他们斩杀。然而，当身边的亲人和朋友接连死去的时候，愚钝的鑢七花开始思考起作为一把刀的价值和意义。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-06-19 00:43:13","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/daoyu/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/daoyu/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/daoyu/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/daoyu/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/daoyu/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/daoyu/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/daoyu/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/daoyu/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/daoyu/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/daoyu/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/daoyu/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/daoyu/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:36:27.860Z"}